      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLASH BOOM BANG (1) crossed over from out wide but caught the leaders turning before drawing clear to score (19.78) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Sure to prove hard to beat. JAKE PERALTA (4) is having his first start around this circuit. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 4.5 lengths (17.94) at Taree Super Track. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Bold showing expected. DELIBERATION (3) has been in sparkling form scoring back to back wins, the latest by 2 lengths (19.54) over 340m at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. In top form and looks a key chance again. LADY LUELLA (2) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in her.",
